  "releaseNotes": "- added safeties against potential divisions by zero to effects\n- adjusted smoothing functions to avoid NaN output with consecutive invalid pitch markers\n- fixed pitch shifting sometimes producing low quality output when no high frequencies are attenuated\n- fixed smoothing function producing minor artifacts when phases are not continuous\n- fixed breathiness control being reversed\n- fixed brightness effect not getting applied\n- removed unnecessary consistency checks from steadiness effect\n        \nknown issues:\n- approximate inverse transform does not produce the expected output\n\nInitial 2.0 release version.",
